sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Visitor
    participant F as Next.js frontend
    participant A as Express API
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant B as Cloud Storage

    rect rgb(240, 246, 252)
    Note over U,M: Search TORs (UC-01, UC-02)
    U->>F: open the search page and type a keyword, set filters
    F->>A: GET /api/tors?q=...&agency=...&budget=...
    A->>A: read session if any (optionalAuth)
    A->>M: aggregate Tor where pipelineStatus = enriched
    Note right of A: a signed-in vendor's hidden TORs are left out
    M-->>A: page of TORs
    A-->>F: list with totalCount and hasNextPage
    F-->>U: result cards with status badges
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 252)
    Note over U,M: View TOR details (UC-05, UC-06, UC-07)
    U->>F: open /tor/:id
    F->>A: GET /api/tors/:id (server-side)
    A->>M: find Tor where pipelineStatus = enriched
    alt not found or not published
        A-->>F: 404
        F-->>U: not-found page
    else found
        M-->>A: Tor with aiSummary and fairnessFlags
        Note right of A: internal fields and admin-only flag details are removed
        A-->>F: tor
        F-->>U: page with AI summary, fairness signals and confidence
        U->>A: POST /api/tors/:id/view (rate limited)
        A->>M: increment viewCount
    end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 250, 244)
    Note over U,B: Download the original PDF (UC-08)
    U->>A: GET /api/tors/:id/document
    A->>M: find Tor where pipelineStatus = enriched, read sourceDocument.storageKey
    A->>B: open stream
    B-->>A: PDF bytes
    A-->>U: PDF
    end
